 Government Scholarship at Fudan is a separate municipal scheme, not part of this record.', funding_type = 'Retired duplicate of record 44 (Fudan University CSC Scholarship)', tuition_coverage = 'Duplicate record: the CSC package at Fudan (tuition, dormitory or accommodation subsidy, CNY 800/year medical insurance, monthly stipend CNY 2,500 / 3,000 / 3,500 by level) is recorded on record 44.', english_requirements = 'See record 44 (HSK 4 for Chinese-taught master''s/doctoral programmes, HSK 3 for Chinese-taught general/senior scholar programmes; host-programme language rules otherwise).', required_documents = '[]', deadline_date = NULL, deadline_type = 'not_published', rounds = '[]', expected_opening_period = NULL, expected_deadline_period = NULL, application_status = 'closed', last_verified_at = '2026-10-29 18:00:00+05', last_updated_at = '2026-10-29 18:00:00+05', notes = COALESCE(notes, '') || ' RETIRED in Pass 127 on 2026-10-29 as a duplicate of record 44 ("Fudan University CSC Scholarship"): both rows record the Chinese Government Scholarship at Fudan University and were re-verified from the same CSC guide on 2026-10-26. The survivor is record 44 (it carries the Fudan source link and the clean side-table row); this row''s fuller verified details — the bachelor''s-to-PhD level span, the Type A/Type B distinction with the Type B stipend caveat, the airfare exclusion and the Shanghai-Government-Scholarship-is-separate pointer — were merged into record 44 in the same pass. The welded university_scholarships row 39 ("Chinese Government Scholarship (CSC) & Shanghai Gov Sch...") at Fudan was deleted; the survivor''s row us 521 remains the single listing, and a Shanghai Government Scholarship record for Fudan, if ever added, needs its own first-hand verification. Retain inactive; do not revive — edit record 44 instead.', is_active = false, award_amount = NULL, award_currency = NULL, award_period = NULL, award_basis = NULL WHERE id = 554;

